---
import BaseLayout from '../../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import GodHero from '../../../components/GodHero.astro';
import GodMarquee from '../../../components/GodMarquee.astro';
import GuaranteeMatrix from '../../../components/GuaranteeMatrix.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Apartment Remodeling in Caracas and Valencia | RemodelaT" description="High-standard apartment remodeling in Caracas, Valencia and Carabobo. Condominium coordination, common-area protection, technical planning and premium finishes." activePage="services">
  <GodHero
  eyebrow="Apartments & condominiums"
  title="Apartment Remodeling"
  titleGold="with Site Control"
  lead="Remodeling for apartments where logistics, condominium rules, dust control, debris handling and finish precision are as important as the design."
  image="/images/cocina-terminada-final.webp"
  imageAlt="Apartment remodeling with premium finishes"
  badges={["High Standard", "Technical Method", "Written Warranty"]}
  watermark="WITH SITE CONTROL"
/>

<GodMarquee />
  <section class="article-section"><div class="container"><div class="article-body">
    <p>Apartment remodeling requires more than construction skill. It requires respecting building rules, protecting elevators and common areas, managing working hours and coordinating deliveries without disrupting the property.</p>
    <h2>What we control</h2>
    <ul><li>Condominium permits, schedules and access.</li><li>Protection of elevators, corridors and common areas.</li><li>Debris handling and daily site order.</li><li>Kitchen, bathroom, flooring, electrical and plumbing coordination.</li><li>Finish checklist before handover.</li></ul>
    <h2>Designed for demanding owners</h2>
    <p>We work for owners who want the apartment to gain value through proper execution: utilities tested before closing, materials specified for each use and finishes aligned with the property level.</p>
    <p><strong>Next step:</strong> <a href="/en/contact">request a technical assessment</a> with the building name, area, apartment size and desired scope.</p>
  </div></div></section>
  <GuaranteeMatrix lang="en" compact />
  <section class="cta-section"><div class="cta-wrapper"><h2 class="cta-title">Planning an apartment remodel?</h2><p class="cta-text">Tell us the area, building rules, scope and finish level so we can prepare a serious technical assessment.</p><a href="/en/contact" class="btn-premium btn-primary-premium"><span class="btn-content">Request apartment assessment</span><span class="btn-border"></span><span class="btn-arrow">→</span></a></div></section>
</BaseLayout>
